Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Representation</div>
<button id="btnPanelA" class="active">(a) Ball-and-stick</button>
<button id="btnPanelB">(b) Line structure + observer</button>
<button id="btnPanelC">(c) Newman projection</button>
<div id="orbitHint" style="font-size:11px;color:#555;line-height:1.35">Drag to orbit the 3D chair (panel a only). Panels (b) and (c) are locked front-on.</div>
