<div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Guided demo</div>
<div id="stepTitle" style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px">1. The 3D chair</div>
<div id="stepText" style="font-size:11px;color:#333;line-height:1.4;min-height:54px">Start with the ball-and-stick model: six carbons pucker into a chair, each carrying one axial and one equatorial hydrogen. Drag to rotate and confirm the ring is not planar.</div>
